WEBVTT

00:00:11.280 --> 00:00:13.320
Shinonome Hangetsu...

00:00:15.850 --> 00:00:18.040
I can't believe it.

00:00:20.420 --> 00:00:23.880
<i>Everyone was crying</i>

00:00:23.880 --> 00:00:27.340
<i>Like a star burning blue</i>

00:00:27.340 --> 00:00:30.720
<i>Where will we go? What will we see?</i>

00:00:30.720 --> 00:00:35.520
<i>We're all going to change, though.</i>

00:00:51.090 --> 00:00:52.940
<i>I don't need it, don't want it.</i>

00:00:52.940 --> 00:00:55.050
<i>I've already given up on it</i>

00:00:55.050 --> 00:00:56.710
<i>After so many sad farewells</i>

00:00:56.710 --> 00:00:59.090
<i>And "take cares"</i>

00:00:59.090 --> 00:01:04.410
<i>I want to like the present more than the past, 
the future more than the present.</i>

00:01:04.920 --> 00:01:08.500
<i>Gradually my values have changed</i>

00:01:08.500 --> 00:01:11.970
<i>I felt more grown up the more they wore away</i>

00:01:11.970 --> 00:01:17.860
<i>Lies and betrayals 
are practically civilities</i>

00:01:17.860 --> 00:01:21.360
<i>Everyone ages</i>

00:01:21.360 --> 00:01:24.840
<i>But what about the star burning blue?</i>

00:01:24.840 --> 00:01:28.180
<i>Our likes and dislikes</i>

00:01:28.180 --> 00:01:31.780
<i>They'll all change at some point</i>

00:01:32.930 --> 00:01:34.650
<i>A worn-out savior</i>

00:01:34.650 --> 00:01:36.330
<i>A medal in a dirty ditch</i>

00:01:36.330 --> 00:01:40.160
<i>I don't want to overlook 
their faint glimmers of light</i>

00:01:40.160 --> 00:01:43.960
<i>I hear the sound still ringing from them</i>

00:01:43.960 --> 00:01:49.480
<i>Let's move on a bit</i>

00:01:50.840 --> 00:01:54.840
<b>Episode 6: The Crow Knight and Shinonome Mikazuki</b>

00:01:53.340 --> 00:01:55.170
<i>It's been several days now.</i>

00:01:56.220 --> 00:02:01.130
<i>She hasn't mentioned Shinonome-san's 
name once in all that time.</i>

00:02:06.390 --> 00:02:08.290
Hey, Amamiya.

00:02:10.620 --> 00:02:14.110
I... think I might have loved that man.

00:02:15.960 --> 00:02:18.570
I never thought I'd cry so much 
when I saw the news.

00:02:19.930 --> 00:02:21.870
Did you shed your tears, as well?

00:02:22.660 --> 00:02:23.680
No.

00:02:24.430 --> 00:02:25.500
Amamiya.

00:02:26.910 --> 00:02:30.350
I'll lend you my chest, 
so go ahead and cry now.

00:02:50.140 --> 00:02:52.860
What are you doing, taking advantage of me?!

00:02:53.220 --> 00:02:55.200
I can't believe you.

00:02:55.200 --> 00:02:57.070
S-Sorry.

00:02:57.770 --> 00:02:59.390
Good grief.

00:03:04.850 --> 00:03:07.240
Oh, you finally smiled.

00:03:07.240 --> 00:03:09.440
From now on, I'll smile for you.

00:03:12.330 --> 00:03:17.280
I'll smile to show you and Sami 
that being an adult is fun.

00:03:20.750 --> 00:03:22.730
I'll smile as much as he would have.

00:03:24.660 --> 00:03:27.100
Well, I guess I should be going.

00:03:33.730 --> 00:03:36.020
Sensei was crying.

00:03:36.020 --> 00:03:38.280
People cry when people die.

00:03:38.280 --> 00:03:39.460
I guess.

00:03:39.460 --> 00:03:41.930
Yuuhi, don't bottle it up.

00:03:41.930 --> 00:03:43.550
Just let go and cry.

00:03:46.700 --> 00:03:49.500
I... longed for this,

00:03:49.500 --> 00:03:51.340
for Shinonome-san's death,

00:03:51.340 --> 00:03:53.120
because one day he'd get in our Princess's way!

00:03:53.120 --> 00:03:54.720
Forget about your logic.

00:03:54.720 --> 00:03:57.670
Just shed your tears 
and clear your head a bit.

00:03:57.670 --> 00:04:00.340
You've clearly been distracted.

00:04:11.360 --> 00:04:12.830
Nice to meet you.

00:04:12.830 --> 00:04:14.690
I'm Shinonome Mikazuki,

00:04:15.130 --> 00:04:16.150
and this is Mu.

00:04:16.150 --> 00:04:19.770
Nice to meet you. 
We're Amamiya Yuuhi and Neu.

00:04:19.770 --> 00:04:20.860
Another Knight?

00:04:20.860 --> 00:04:23.080
Amamiya-kun, huh?

00:04:23.080 --> 00:04:25.530
Sorry to ask so suddenly,

00:04:26.040 --> 00:04:27.990
but would you fight me?

00:04:28.290 --> 00:04:29.200
No way.

00:04:33.040 --> 00:04:36.170
But I came out and asked you openly!

00:04:36.920 --> 00:04:39.300
You'll regret that!

00:04:46.640 --> 00:04:48.800
<i>Shinonome-san's little brother, huh?</i>

00:04:55.070 --> 00:04:56.820
Oh, what a coincidence.

00:04:56.820 --> 00:04:58.360
Hisame-chan, thanks for the meal.

00:04:58.360 --> 00:04:59.990
Show me more respect!

00:05:00.710 --> 00:05:01.710
Later!

00:05:03.460 --> 00:05:05.220
Shinonome-san's little brother?

00:05:05.220 --> 00:05:06.820
Yes, that's right.

00:05:07.900 --> 00:05:11.330
Oh, it's the manga I lent Shinonome-san.

00:05:08.370 --> 00:05:11.330
Magical Girl
Magical Marie

00:05:11.330 --> 00:05:13.820
That guy dropped by to return it.

00:05:14.240 --> 00:05:16.010
Also, Amamiya...

00:05:16.670 --> 00:05:20.130
Mikazuki ate your share of breakfast.

00:05:23.690 --> 00:05:27.380
This part isn't important, so you don't 
need to focus on remembering it.

00:05:28.010 --> 00:05:30.670
Sorry I'm late!

00:05:30.670 --> 00:05:33.140
Sensei, Teach, Professor...

00:05:33.140 --> 00:05:34.890
Is that a wig?

00:05:34.890 --> 00:05:36.560
Yes, it is.

00:05:38.670 --> 00:05:40.330
You all liked that?

00:05:42.180 --> 00:05:45.360
So then we became best buds.

00:05:45.360 --> 00:05:47.530
It was such a mess!

00:05:48.740 --> 00:05:49.790
That's right!

00:05:52.420 --> 00:05:56.230
I'm still surprised both 
brothers are Ring Knights.

00:05:56.230 --> 00:05:57.970
Yeah, that's true.

00:06:05.840 --> 00:06:07.070
Hmm.

00:06:07.070 --> 00:06:09.180
So my brother was a knight, as well?

00:06:10.540 --> 00:06:11.770
You're so glum!

00:06:11.770 --> 00:06:13.360
Can you really fight like that?

00:06:13.360 --> 00:06:14.520
Mikazuki-san.

00:06:14.520 --> 00:06:16.140
Just Mikazuki is fine.

00:06:16.140 --> 00:06:18.780
Mikazuki-san.

00:06:18.780 --> 00:06:21.490
At the very least, I have no 
intention of fighting you.

00:06:21.490 --> 00:06:23.890
Tch! You're no fun.

00:06:23.890 --> 00:06:26.060
Are you moping over what 
happened to my brother?

00:06:27.490 --> 00:06:29.740
I heard you were friends with him?

00:06:30.750 --> 00:06:35.730
We... were friends.

00:06:37.870 --> 00:06:41.530
So, Hisame-chan's little sister 
is the Princess, right?

00:06:42.240 --> 00:06:44.800
I killed Shinonome-san.

00:06:46.030 --> 00:06:48.020
Even the Whirlwind was only human.

00:06:48.020 --> 00:06:49.570
He was going to die one day.

00:06:49.570 --> 00:06:50.420
Whirlwind?

00:06:50.420 --> 00:06:52.590
Quit looking so depressed.

00:06:52.590 --> 00:06:55.810
You have to protect 
the Princess and the Earth.

00:06:55.810 --> 00:06:58.270
All right! Let's get pumped up!

00:06:58.270 --> 00:06:58.930
Huh?

00:06:58.930 --> 00:07:00.520
Let's play catch!

00:07:00.520 --> 00:07:02.770
Come on, come on, take off your glasses.

00:07:06.490 --> 00:07:08.690
Why remove his glasses?

00:07:08.690 --> 00:07:10.430
Over here, over here.

00:07:13.460 --> 00:07:14.460
Huh?!

00:07:15.990 --> 00:07:17.080
Come on!

00:07:17.080 --> 00:07:19.770
We're playing catch, so you're up next.

00:07:19.770 --> 00:07:21.920
Come on, what's the matter? Bring it!

00:07:22.650 --> 00:07:24.720
Can't you get pumped up?

00:07:24.720 --> 00:07:28.910
Well, I guess I can understand 
not wanting to protect the Princess

00:07:28.910 --> 00:07:30.420
when she's such a brat.

00:07:30.420 --> 00:07:32.380
Her looks aren't that great, either.

00:07:32.380 --> 00:07:33.890
She looks dumb, too.

00:07:38.720 --> 00:07:41.130
See, you can do it, too!

00:07:43.070 --> 00:07:45.440
Laughing it off like that... 
What's wrong with you?!

00:07:53.660 --> 00:07:56.620
Come on, you're up next, Amamiya-kun!

00:07:56.620 --> 00:07:58.600
You should hate me!

00:07:58.600 --> 00:08:02.120
Shinonome-san died protecting me!

00:08:02.120 --> 00:08:04.170
He died because of me!

00:08:09.850 --> 00:08:13.250
My older brother died protecting you?

00:08:13.250 --> 00:08:14.480
That true?

00:08:14.930 --> 00:08:15.740
Yeah.

00:08:15.740 --> 00:08:19.190
I guess you could say you killed him, then.

00:08:19.520 --> 00:08:21.230
Which means...

00:08:21.720 --> 00:08:23.690
if I defeat you...

00:08:23.690 --> 00:08:26.150
I'll be able to surpass my older brother!

00:08:27.610 --> 00:08:31.320
Your fate is what killed my brother!

00:08:31.320 --> 00:08:34.180
That means your fate was stronger than his!

00:08:34.180 --> 00:08:37.490
If you're stronger than him, 
then I just need to surpass you!

00:08:39.060 --> 00:08:42.790
I didn't think I still had a chance 
to surpass my brother.

00:08:42.790 --> 00:08:45.520
My brother gave you a push forward

00:08:45.520 --> 00:08:48.170
while I've been chasing after him!

00:08:48.470 --> 00:08:51.200
And we both just happen to be knights, too!

00:08:51.200 --> 00:08:55.680
It's like a red thread of fate crafted 
for a third-rate author's convenience!

00:08:57.640 --> 00:08:59.470
<i>What's with this guy?</i>

00:08:59.470 --> 00:09:01.060
<i>He's insane.</i>

00:09:03.100 --> 00:09:05.220
Now, let's get to fighting,

00:09:05.220 --> 00:09:07.350
my destined rival!

00:09:09.110 --> 00:09:12.440
<i>Wh-What incredible bloodlust! 
No, madness!</i>

00:09:12.440 --> 00:09:13.480
<i>It's overwhelming!</i>

00:09:15.740 --> 00:09:17.200
H-Huh?

00:09:24.120 --> 00:09:25.830
P-Princess?

00:09:25.830 --> 00:09:27.440
I did it.

00:09:27.440 --> 00:09:29.100
Shinonome-san's technique.

00:09:29.940 --> 00:09:31.790
It wasn't all for naught.

00:09:31.790 --> 00:09:33.840
All our time with Shinonome-san...

00:09:40.530 --> 00:09:42.250
Yuu-kun, Mikazuki-san!

00:09:42.250 --> 00:09:44.350
From now on, personal fights 
between knights are forbidden!

00:09:44.350 --> 00:09:45.650
As you wish!

00:09:45.650 --> 00:09:48.190
I can't accept that order.

00:09:48.190 --> 00:09:51.100
Personal fights are what 
I live for, you know?

00:09:51.100 --> 00:09:53.290
Still, I'll withdraw for today.

00:09:57.120 --> 00:09:58.320
I've fallen for you!

00:10:00.030 --> 00:10:01.040
Wha?!

00:10:03.430 --> 00:10:04.370
Ah!

00:10:05.960 --> 00:10:07.210
Behind you.

00:10:18.130 --> 00:10:19.330
Pleasure to meet you.

00:10:19.330 --> 00:10:21.250
I'm Nagumo Souichirou and this is

00:10:21.250 --> 00:10:22.650
Dance Dark.

00:10:23.130 --> 00:10:24.810
I'm the Horse Knight!

00:10:25.150 --> 00:10:27.220
So you're all in this city.

00:10:27.220 --> 00:10:29.890
I've been looking for you, 
Princess, Neu, Mu.

00:10:29.890 --> 00:10:32.080
Such a big horse!

00:10:32.080 --> 00:10:33.520
So cool!

00:10:33.520 --> 00:10:34.640
Horsey, horsey, horsey!

00:10:34.640 --> 00:10:36.370
It's my first time seeing one!

00:10:37.120 --> 00:10:38.740
Listen up, all three of you.

00:10:38.740 --> 00:10:40.830
There are twelve knights in total.

00:10:40.830 --> 00:10:46.200
I've already made contact with Loki the owl, 
Kuh the black cat, and Sia the snake.

00:10:46.500 --> 00:10:49.410
<i>The Snake Knight, Sia?</i>

00:10:49.680 --> 00:10:52.620
Shinonome Hangetsu 
was a Knight, as well, right?

00:10:52.620 --> 00:10:53.400
Yeah.

00:10:53.880 --> 00:10:55.930
It's a shame we've lost that man.

00:10:56.880 --> 00:10:58.330
We are the Beast Knights,

00:10:58.330 --> 00:11:00.760
the guardians of the planet,

00:11:00.760 --> 00:11:03.350
defending Earth from the Biscuit Hammer!

00:11:03.740 --> 00:11:07.460
We'll crush the one trying 
to destroy this planet before he can!

00:11:07.460 --> 00:11:09.730
That should be your only thought 
in the battles to come!

00:11:09.730 --> 00:11:11.900
Always be prepared to die.

00:11:11.900 --> 00:11:15.000
You should have the wish granted 
by your pact sooner than later.

00:11:15.000 --> 00:11:17.640
And remember to treasure every day you have.

00:11:18.420 --> 00:11:19.830
Let's meet again soon.

00:11:24.440 --> 00:11:27.270
Oh, I just remembered something, 
so I'll be heading off.

00:11:31.120 --> 00:11:33.760
<i>Be prepared to die, huh?</i>

00:11:38.260 --> 00:11:39.870
Those who protect Earth...

00:11:40.460 --> 00:11:43.840
Eventually I'll have to stand
 against the other ten Knights.

00:11:44.240 --> 00:11:46.480
That's how it'll be one day.

00:11:46.920 --> 00:11:48.310
And when it does happen...

00:11:49.130 --> 00:11:50.620
I'll order you.

00:11:51.440 --> 00:11:55.210
To face all ten alone 
and defeat every last one.

00:11:55.560 --> 00:11:56.910
As you command.

00:11:56.910 --> 00:12:00.940
I'll face all ten alone 
and defeat every last one.

00:12:02.260 --> 00:12:05.040
<i>The curtain had already closed 
on the prologue before I even realized it,</i>

00:12:05.850 --> 00:12:09.170
<i>and now the next chapter 
of our tale was starting.</i>

00:12:13.890 --> 00:12:15.540
Good grief.

00:12:15.540 --> 00:12:18.130
Hey, want to have some fun?

00:12:28.410 --> 00:12:29.710
Damn it!

00:12:29.710 --> 00:12:33.560
That Nagumo dude is crazy-fast!

00:12:37.690 --> 00:12:39.680
You came here just to make that report?

00:12:39.680 --> 00:12:42.680
Nah, I just wanted someone to talk to.

00:12:42.680 --> 00:12:44.370
Oh, no need to be polite with me.

00:12:44.370 --> 00:12:45.960
Then, I won't.

00:12:46.980 --> 00:12:49.450
Now quit barging into my home 
and eating my cabbage!

00:12:49.450 --> 00:12:52.040
Huh? But it was in the fridge.

00:12:52.040 --> 00:12:54.320
How is that a reason?!

00:12:54.320 --> 00:12:55.920
Don't open my fridge without asking!

00:12:58.470 --> 00:12:59.460
Forget it.

00:12:59.460 --> 00:13:01.200
Just pay for the cabbage and beat it.

00:13:01.200 --> 00:13:03.300
Huh? Come on, let's chat.

00:13:03.300 --> 00:13:06.010
Go home now!

00:13:07.470 --> 00:13:13.360
So that Mikazuki did run off 
to challenge Nagumo-dono.

00:13:13.360 --> 00:13:15.070
He's an easy one to understand.

00:13:15.070 --> 00:13:17.440
Hmph. Hopefully they crush each other.

00:13:18.190 --> 00:13:19.760
You're no better.

00:13:23.740 --> 00:13:26.360
You should have the wish granted 
by your pact sooner than later!

00:13:29.160 --> 00:13:33.110
<i>I wonder what Shinonome-san 
wished for on the brink of death.</i>

00:13:39.200 --> 00:13:40.100
It's here.

00:13:41.070 --> 00:13:44.670
A reaction both north and south? 
Two of them?!

00:13:49.430 --> 00:13:50.510
She's not answering.

00:13:51.500 --> 00:13:53.390
You can't reach the Princess?

00:13:53.390 --> 00:13:55.480
<i>No. What should we do?</i>

00:13:55.750 --> 00:14:00.010
Then let's focus on the golem 
in the mountains to the south.

00:14:00.010 --> 00:14:01.430
I'll head that way, too.

00:14:01.430 --> 00:14:02.590
<i>All right.</i>

00:14:02.590 --> 00:14:06.220
Apparently, we can deal 
more damage to the golems

00:14:06.220 --> 00:14:08.630
if we combine two or more Holding Fields.

00:14:08.630 --> 00:14:10.630
Three or more can deliver a decisive blow.

00:14:10.630 --> 00:14:14.140
So even if you find one, don't approach 
until you join up with the others.

00:14:16.360 --> 00:14:18.680
So that was what you meant

00:14:18.680 --> 00:14:22.140
when you told me to work 
together with the others?

00:14:22.140 --> 00:14:22.960
That's right.

00:14:22.960 --> 00:14:24.840
Yuuhi, let's head there quickly!

00:14:26.010 --> 00:14:26.820
What's wrong?

00:14:26.820 --> 00:14:27.860
I know.

00:14:37.020 --> 00:14:40.340
The golems are stronger 
than a single Knight.

00:14:40.340 --> 00:14:42.480
Won't they entertain you more?

00:14:42.480 --> 00:14:47.220
Then they'll be the main dish 
and you'll be the hors d'oeuvre!

00:14:47.220 --> 00:14:48.800
I'm speechless.

00:14:57.650 --> 00:14:58.660
There it is!

00:15:04.250 --> 00:15:05.610
So weak!

00:15:05.610 --> 00:15:06.460
Hm?

00:15:07.210 --> 00:15:09.150
Wait, no one's here.

00:15:09.150 --> 00:15:11.130
Did they head down to the mountain?

00:15:11.130 --> 00:15:13.410
I really shouldn't be 
forgetting my cellphone.

00:15:20.780 --> 00:15:23.770
I'm short on time, so I went all-out.

00:15:23.770 --> 00:15:27.190
I don't mind. That was fun.

00:15:27.190 --> 00:15:29.070
How was this fun?!

00:15:29.070 --> 00:15:33.450
Don't go stepping onto the battlefield 
if you're just fooling around!

00:15:34.320 --> 00:15:35.410
Huh?

00:15:35.410 --> 00:15:37.990
We're all serious about this fight.

00:15:38.280 --> 00:15:41.150
You pale in comparison 
to Hangetsu the Whirlwind.

00:15:44.010 --> 00:15:45.960
Bastard...

00:15:46.480 --> 00:15:48.020
I guess I'm the first one here?

00:15:48.920 --> 00:15:51.090
Still, what is this?

00:15:51.600 --> 00:15:54.980
I don't sense any will to fight 
from this golem.

00:15:54.980 --> 00:15:57.550
Its presence is weak, too, which is creepy.

00:15:57.550 --> 00:15:59.610
All the more reason to wait for backup.

00:15:59.610 --> 00:16:00.650
I'm not waiting.

00:16:00.650 --> 00:16:04.760
I can defeat a slow-witted, 
gutless golem like that by myself.

00:16:05.150 --> 00:16:06.950
<i>It's all right.</i>

00:16:06.950 --> 00:16:09.100
<i>I can defeat that one by myself.</i>

00:16:09.100 --> 00:16:10.700
<i>I'm not terrified.</i>

00:16:10.700 --> 00:16:13.300
Wait, Yuuhi! You're acting strange!

00:16:18.030 --> 00:16:19.370
Calm down!

00:16:31.420 --> 00:16:32.700
Yuuhi!

00:16:47.390 --> 00:16:49.390
Ahh, that was scary.

00:16:49.390 --> 00:16:51.710
I'm glad it ran away.

00:16:51.710 --> 00:16:56.150
Looks like it didn't want to 
fight in the first place.

00:16:56.150 --> 00:16:57.940
Are you all right?

00:17:02.850 --> 00:17:04.390
Its presence vanished?

00:17:04.940 --> 00:17:06.500
I wonder if Yuu-kun's safe.

00:17:09.840 --> 00:17:11.840
<i>I've faced death many times now,</i>

00:17:12.730 --> 00:17:16.550
<i>but the shock of witnessing the moment 
a familiar face turned into a corpse</i>

00:17:16.550 --> 00:17:20.850
<i>must have hit me harder than I realized.</i>

00:17:25.560 --> 00:17:29.670
Nagumo-san asked me to come check up on you.

00:17:29.670 --> 00:17:31.680
Is it okay if I come in?

00:17:31.680 --> 00:17:32.900
Go ahead.

00:17:33.260 --> 00:17:34.990
I'll open the curtains.

00:17:37.250 --> 00:17:39.240
Amamiya-kun, right?

00:17:39.240 --> 00:17:43.410
I'm Hakudou Yayoi. It's nice to meet you.

00:17:43.840 --> 00:17:45.220
Nice to meet you.

00:17:45.220 --> 00:17:46.490
Are you okay?

00:17:46.490 --> 00:17:48.080
I'm perfectly fine.

00:17:48.510 --> 00:17:51.500
You big liar. Your face is real pale.

00:17:52.560 --> 00:17:53.800
Mercy, mercy!

00:17:53.800 --> 00:17:56.260
Yako, he bullied me!

00:17:56.260 --> 00:17:58.680
I'm not Yako, I'm Yayoi.

00:17:58.680 --> 00:18:01.140
And you were rude to him first, you know.

00:18:01.140 --> 00:18:03.940
Sia. Sia Moon.

00:18:03.940 --> 00:18:06.760
Do you remember me?

00:18:06.760 --> 00:18:09.280
Hmm? I don't recall.

00:18:09.280 --> 00:18:12.260
I did make an early exit last time.

00:18:12.260 --> 00:18:13.760
I see.

00:18:13.760 --> 00:18:18.870
Last time the Snake Knight died 
defending us, the Lizard Knight.

00:18:18.870 --> 00:18:22.310
Hmm... But that happens all the time, doesn't it?

00:18:22.310 --> 00:18:23.810
It does...

00:18:23.810 --> 00:18:26.910
But your aid was all for naught, 
as immediately afterward...

00:18:27.320 --> 00:18:30.920
I'll say this now, but don't go trying 
to return the favor, okay?

00:18:30.920 --> 00:18:34.910
We don't have time to worry about 
petty things like debts in this battle.

00:18:34.910 --> 00:18:36.340
I know that.

00:18:37.780 --> 00:18:40.050
Sia, I think we should be going.

00:18:40.050 --> 00:18:41.440
Okay.

00:18:42.890 --> 00:18:46.450
Amamiya-kun, don't come 
to the battlefield, okay?

00:18:46.450 --> 00:18:48.310
You'll just get in the way.

00:18:55.580 --> 00:18:56.570
Neu.

00:18:56.830 --> 00:18:58.020
What?

00:18:58.020 --> 00:18:59.840
What do you mean, she saved you?

00:18:59.840 --> 00:19:00.820
Yeah.

00:19:00.820 --> 00:19:03.300
Though I was killed immediately 
after she saved me,

00:19:03.300 --> 00:19:06.390
so their death was for naught.

00:19:06.390 --> 00:19:09.270
So if I were to die without 
accomplishing anything,

00:19:09.270 --> 00:19:11.730
it would mean Shinonome-san 
and Ludo's deaths were for naught, too.

00:19:11.730 --> 00:19:14.370
Yuuhi, don't be reckless.

00:19:15.370 --> 00:19:16.370
I will.

00:19:17.090 --> 00:19:20.880
No matter how scared I am, 
I already had my wish granted.

00:19:35.740 --> 00:19:37.470
What?

00:19:37.470 --> 00:19:39.070
Nothing.

00:19:45.570 --> 00:19:46.530
There it is!

00:19:46.530 --> 00:19:49.190
It looks different from 
the one I crushed last time.

00:19:53.650 --> 00:19:54.920
Yuuhi! Stop!

00:19:54.920 --> 00:19:57.920
Leave it to Hakudou and Nagumo-dono!

00:19:57.920 --> 00:19:59.620
Yo!

00:20:01.470 --> 00:20:05.560
Sou-chan, let me show you the results 
of my training in the mountains.

00:20:11.090 --> 00:20:16.310
I guess I'll just have to break your limbs 
so you won't interfere a second time.

00:20:19.170 --> 00:20:21.900
Turn back! You'll die this time!

00:20:22.710 --> 00:20:23.970
<i>I'm scared.</i>

00:20:23.970 --> 00:20:25.150
<i>I can't stop shaking.</i>

00:20:25.150 --> 00:20:26.440
Yuuhi!

00:20:30.230 --> 00:20:32.790
Amamiya-kun, rest there.

00:20:33.370 --> 00:20:36.020
Let us handle stalling it.

00:20:36.020 --> 00:20:38.290
Right now, you'd just get in the way.

00:20:38.290 --> 00:20:41.220
They're fighting the golem alone?

00:20:41.220 --> 00:20:42.820
Hey, that's foolish!

00:20:49.010 --> 00:20:50.970
<i>It's different from the one before?</i>

00:20:51.410 --> 00:20:52.780
Holding Field,

00:20:52.780 --> 00:20:53.850
Flamberge!

00:20:57.020 --> 00:20:58.610
Yuuhi! Follow S—

00:20:58.610 --> 00:21:02.640
N-No, the two of them won't die! Fall back!

00:21:02.640 --> 00:21:05.030
Are you sure? Are you really okay with that?

00:21:06.450 --> 00:21:08.920
How many times has the Princess saved me?

00:21:08.920 --> 00:21:12.870
I even let Shinonome-san 
die after he saved me.

00:21:12.870 --> 00:21:16.620
I know I'm a powerless, cowardly, useless,

00:21:16.620 --> 00:21:18.770
weak, gloomy four-eyes,

00:21:18.770 --> 00:21:19.770
but still...

00:21:20.170 --> 00:21:22.460
even I want to be a hero!

00:21:22.460 --> 00:21:24.950
I can't let myself be saved 
by others all the time!

00:21:25.630 --> 00:21:28.450
Neu! It's the same for you, right?!

00:21:28.450 --> 00:21:33.090
You've always endured your own 
powerlessness after Sia and Ludo saved you!

00:21:34.060 --> 00:21:36.920
So say it! Tell me your wish!

00:21:37.900 --> 00:21:40.820
Ask me to do it! We're friends, aren't we?!

00:21:41.800 --> 00:21:44.740
<i>That day, you were truly my hero.</i>

00:21:46.240 --> 00:21:49.840
<i>Now give me courage, hero!</i>

00:21:50.360 --> 00:21:51.570
Yuuhi...

00:21:53.660 --> 00:21:58.030
Please... Save Sia! Save the Snake Knight!

00:21:59.120 --> 00:22:01.210
Leave it to me, my friend!

00:22:13.890 --> 00:22:15.210
<i>It's useless.</i>

00:22:15.210 --> 00:22:17.480
<i>At this rate... I'll die.</i>

00:22:24.510 --> 00:22:25.530
Amamiya-kun?!

00:22:26.440 --> 00:22:28.570
<i>Now here's where Shinonome-san would...</i>

00:22:37.040 --> 00:22:38.750
G-Golem!

00:22:42.670 --> 00:22:44.970
I'm your opponent!

00:22:44.970 --> 00:22:48.210
Bring it on!

00:22:57.100 --> 00:23:05.270
<i>Looking back to those times, 
I always thought</i>

00:23:05.270 --> 00:23:09.860
<i>It was hard to live life true to myself.</i>

00:23:10.450 --> 00:23:13.530
<i>I recall those times.</i>

00:23:13.530 --> 00:23:17.080
<i>I wanted to forget, 
but now it's different.</i>

00:23:17.080 --> 00:23:22.830
<i>Back then we stared at that same sky.</i>

00:23:23.960 --> 00:23:29.460
<i>I'll never forget you, 
or our endless dreams</i>

00:23:29.460 --> 00:23:35.970
<i>As we gazed at that sky 
after fate brought us together</i>

00:23:35.970 --> 00:23:41.600
<i>I dream of us together, 
of those days I remember</i>

00:23:41.600 --> 00:23:43.770
<i>But dreams end and I wake up</i>

00:23:43.770 --> 00:23:48.320
<i>Seeking the future</i>

00:23:49.190 --> 00:23:54.410
<i>I reach for the light,</i>

00:23:55.240 --> 00:24:00.790
<i>Always thinking of you in</i>

00:24:04.420 --> 00:24:13.760
<i>every little thing</i>

00:24:22.440 --> 00:24:27.430
<b>Next Episode:
Amamiya Yuuhi and the Beast Knights (Part 1)\h\h\h\h</b>
